    "detailed_description": "Puzzling Wild introduces this IQ Test of logic and visual reasoning. There are no instructions. You are shown some examples and have to find the patterns. These IQ Tests were developed by a Professor to try to test the intelligence of AI robots. Are you smarter than a robot? Can you solve all 400 by your self?<br />\r\n<br />\r\nThe puzzles are introduced by our good friends Ginger the Giraffe, and Hugo Hippo. The most famous animal podcasters. <br />\r\n<br />\r\nAs you solve more puzzles, you unlock more podcast conversations between Ginger and Hugo. <br />\r\n<br />\r\nWe estimate your IQ by comparing your score to the everyone else's score using custom algorithms.<br />\r\n<br />\r\nThese puzzles are excellent brain training.  \ud83e\udd2f<br />\r\n<br />\r\nHow well is your brain working today? \ud83e\udde0<br />\r\n<br />\r\nThere are subtitles for the conversations in about 26 different languages. <br />\r\n<br />\r\nHave fun.",
